      <div type="clause" n="1.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III Eg</ref> 1.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ sy on ðare bote swilc forgifnes, swilce hit for Gode gebeorhlic sy ⁊ for worlde aberendlic.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And that there be such remission in the case of compensations as shall be justifiable in the sight of God and acceptable in the eyes of men.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ sý on þære bote swylc forgifnes, swylce hit for Gode gebeorglic sy ⁊ for worulde aberendlic.</ab>
      </div>
